1
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage
depicted in this series]

2
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference
for traditional Thai massage.]

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate
any of the techniques shown,]

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,800
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

8
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:17,840
Are you sure Phat is helping you out of the goodness of his heart?

9
00:00:17,871 --> 00:00:21,440
Think about why he killed Dongyang and is still alive…Master Tim.

10
00:00:22,712 --> 00:00:26,360
Police Colonel Krit Teeranasakul.

11
00:00:27,827 --> 00:00:28,828
Hattha.

12
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,400
I'm sorry to bother you at home, sir.

13
00:00:34,431 --> 00:00:36,800
My father, Uncle Doctor In, and the caregiver

14
00:00:36,832 --> 00:00:38,760
have been kidnapped by Master Tim and taken to Arokaya.

15
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,080
Please help me, sir.

16
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,720
I think Master Tim knows the people who attacked my family in Phuket.

17
00:00:42,744 --> 00:00:46,440
And do you still have any evidence from that case?

18
00:00:46,656 --> 00:00:49,000
- Yes, I do.
- Let's go right away.

19
00:00:49,057 --> 00:00:50,700
So we can get this whole thing sorted out.

20
00:00:51,792 --> 00:00:54,400
- Don't worry. I'll have the housekeeper take care of it.
- It's okay.

21
00:00:54,539 --> 00:00:55,811
- I can clean it.
- No, it's fine.

22
00:00:55,848 --> 00:00:56,849
You're Flatfoot!

23
00:01:00,446 --> 00:01:02,760
You're Flatfoot! You killed my mom!

24
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,881
Hey! What are you doing?

25
00:01:06,081 --> 00:01:07,082
Stop!

26
00:01:07,091 --> 00:01:09,040
I've been waiting for you to finally figure it out.

27
00:02:09,352 --> 00:02:10,353
You...

28
00:02:21,664 --> 00:02:23,440
You worthless parasites

29
00:02:23,899 --> 00:02:26,720
have been getting in the way of my business for far too long.

30
00:02:42,094 --> 00:02:43,095
Dad.

31
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,591
Don't!

32
00:02:52,608 --> 00:02:54,440
Hey, wait!

33
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,280
You killed Dongyang because of this bitch, didn't you?

34
00:02:57,862 --> 00:03:01,520
You didn't kill him for me. You killed Dongyang for her!

35
00:03:02,934 --> 00:03:03,935
- Dad!
- Hey!

36
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:04,961
Just let her go.

37
00:03:05,579 --> 00:03:07,000
Dad, I'm begging you.

38
00:03:08,900 --> 00:03:09,920
You're in love with her, aren't you?

39
00:03:12,736 --> 00:03:14,480
Can a hitman like you even love someone?

40
00:03:15,437 --> 00:03:16,438
Huh?

41
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:19,472
Have you ever asked her if she loves you back?

42
00:03:20,992 --> 00:03:22,880
I'd like to know if she'd still love you

43
00:03:23,227 --> 00:03:24,700
if she found out your father killed her mother.

44
00:03:26,448 --> 00:03:27,449
Would she still love you then?

45
00:03:30,550 --> 00:03:31,680
You're such a fool.

46
00:03:33,904 --> 00:03:35,520
Just as stupid as your mother.

47
00:03:38,728 --> 00:03:40,729
What am I supposed to do with you, Phat? Huh?

48
00:03:41,566 --> 00:03:43,920
What kind of son are you? You're nothing like me!

49
00:03:57,534 --> 00:03:58,535
Dad.

50
00:04:00,211 --> 00:04:01,412
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

51
00:04:05,854 --> 00:04:06,920
I love Hattha.

52
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,961
Please let her go.

53
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:13,901
So tell me,

54
00:04:14,163 --> 00:04:17,320
are you supposed to obey my orders, or am I supposed to obey yours?

55
00:04:18,158 --> 00:04:19,159
Huh?

56
00:04:20,159 --> 00:04:21,160
Answer me!

57
00:04:22,550 --> 00:04:23,551
Answer me!

58
00:04:26,262 --> 00:04:27,680
Whatever you want me to do, Dad,

59
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,120
I'll do anything for you.

60
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,920
All I ask is that you let me have her.

61
00:04:36,107 --> 00:04:37,108
I won't allow it!

62
00:04:38,955 --> 00:04:40,200
And right now,

63
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,200
I'm ordering you to kill her!

64
00:04:44,694 --> 00:04:46,000
- Dad!
- Kill that bitch right now!

65
00:04:46,045 --> 00:04:47,650
- Dad, I'm begging you!
- Now!

66
00:04:55,507 --> 00:04:56,508
Dad!

67
00:04:58,819 --> 00:04:59,960
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

68
00:05:00,398 --> 00:05:01,560
If you won't do it,

69
00:05:02,574 --> 00:05:03,720
I'll kill her myself!

70
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,361
Dad!

71
00:05:30,851 --> 00:05:32,200
Hey, Phat!

72
00:05:36,963 --> 00:05:38,040
- Phat!
- Go!

73
00:05:38,088 --> 00:05:39,089
- Phat!
- Go!

74
00:05:41,742 --> 00:05:42,743
Phat!

75
00:05:44,355 --> 00:05:45,356
Phat!

76
00:05:45,736 --> 00:05:46,800
You son of a bitch!

77
00:05:50,198 --> 00:05:51,199
Hop on!

78
00:05:52,984 --> 00:05:53,985
Phat!

79
00:06:26,379 --> 00:06:27,380
Stop!

80
00:06:28,283 --> 00:06:29,284
Stop!

81
00:06:34,382 --> 00:06:35,383
Hattha.

82
00:06:36,094 --> 00:06:37,095
Hattha.

83
00:06:37,752 --> 00:06:38,753
Hattha.

84
00:06:40,147 --> 00:06:41,680
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

85
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:44,840
You knew all along that your father killed my mother, didn't you?

86
00:06:45,872 --> 00:06:46,880
You were trying to deceive me!

87
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:47,961
No, Hattha.

88
00:06:48,166 --> 00:06:50,080
Hattha, I wasn't lying to you.

89
00:06:50,310 --> 00:06:52,920
And I only recently found out he was the man you wanted to kill.

90
00:06:53,464 --> 00:06:55,040
You told me to stay away from that flatfoot bastard.

91
00:06:55,065 --> 00:06:56,700
And go back home to my father in Photharam.

92
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,880
- You were trying to protect your father!
- Was I protecting him back there?

93
00:07:02,867 --> 00:07:04,050
I know you're angry with me.

94
00:07:05,304 --> 00:07:06,840
But I can't change the fact that I'm his son.

95
00:07:12,462 --> 00:07:13,520
Then stay away from me!

96
00:07:13,848 --> 00:07:14,849
Hattha.

97
00:07:14,851 --> 00:07:16,400
- What can I do to make you trust me?
- Let go of me!

98
00:07:16,755 --> 00:07:17,756
Hattha.

99
00:07:19,294 --> 00:07:20,960
Trying to help your father

100
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,200
and kill him is far too dangerous.

101
00:07:23,379 --> 00:07:25,520
- Stay out of it!
- You can't do this alone, understand?

102
00:07:27,363 --> 00:07:29,280
My father has planted someone inside Arokaya.

103
00:07:29,592 --> 00:07:31,832
You'll get caught before you even reach him.

104
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,481
I told you to stay out of it!

105
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,296
Hattha! Hattha!

106
00:07:37,139 --> 00:07:38,160
If you don't trust me,

107
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,201
then shoot me.

108
00:09:59,499 --> 00:10:00,500
Hello!

109
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,521
- Hello!
- Where's Hattha?

110
00:10:02,182 --> 00:10:03,240
- Hattha!
- Wan!

111
00:10:05,072 --> 00:10:07,240
What? Mr. Krit did this to you?

112
00:10:08,273 --> 00:10:09,274
How did you know, Wan?

113
00:10:09,531 --> 00:10:12,400
Phat called and told me you'd snuck into Mr. Krit's house.

114
00:10:12,736 --> 00:10:14,237
Thank goodness he got you out of there.

115
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,800
Did he also tell you how he managed to get in and out?

116
00:10:16,810 --> 00:10:17,811
Because it's his father's house.

117
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,481
What?

118
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,161
Phat is Mr. Krit's son?

119
00:10:22,411 --> 00:10:24,040
No wonder nobody can touch him.

120
00:10:24,950 --> 00:10:26,151
Even after he killed Dongyang.

121
00:10:28,150 --> 00:10:30,800
No wonder Phat always seemed so mysterious.

122
00:10:31,019 --> 00:10:32,600
He barely talks to anyone.

123
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:35,000
When I saw him getting close to Hattha,

124
00:10:35,071 --> 00:10:37,280
I wondered when they had become so close.

125
00:10:40,072 --> 00:10:41,400
It was probably because of his father's orders.

126
00:10:42,678 --> 00:10:43,680
What does Mr. Krit have to do with this?

127
00:10:44,558 --> 00:10:46,120
This morning, I went there to find out

128
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:49,500
if he really had a scar on his foot. And he did!

129
00:10:51,491 --> 00:10:53,120
Mr. Krit is that flatfoot bastard who killed my mother.

130
00:10:55,483 --> 00:10:58,520
I never imagined Mr. Krit could be so evil.

131
00:10:59,344 --> 00:11:01,280
He looks so respectable in this picture.

132
00:11:01,590 --> 00:11:04,680
I was even thinking that if he became the party leader,

133
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:07,100
I'd vote for him as prime minister in the next election.

134
00:11:09,243 --> 00:11:10,744
Like father, like son. They're both good at putting on an act.

135
00:11:14,291 --> 00:11:15,292
They're despicable!

136
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,151
Master Tim!

137
00:11:39,654 --> 00:11:40,655
Master Tim!

138
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:42,901
What are you doing?

139
00:11:47,401 --> 00:11:48,960
Why didn't you kill that bastard Korn?

140
00:11:49,611 --> 00:11:50,612
Why the hell did you let him live?

141
00:11:50,891 --> 00:11:51,892
Don't worry.

142
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,700
I won't let him cause you any trouble, sir.

143
00:11:55,451 --> 00:11:56,452
Goddamn it!

144
00:11:56,883 --> 00:11:59,720
You knew he was still alive, but you deliberately kept it from me!

145
00:12:00,243 --> 00:12:02,035
How the hell am I supposed to trust you anymore?

146
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,542
Can we discuss this like civilized people?

147
00:12:04,595 --> 00:12:05,596
Fine.

148
00:12:09,768 --> 00:12:11,600
Why did you capture those bastards?

149
00:12:12,238 --> 00:12:13,239
What do you want?

150
00:12:14,526 --> 00:12:16,700
Korn and I studied massage therapy together.

151
00:12:19,979 --> 00:12:23,400
I once asked him to help me develop a massage technique that could kill.

152
00:12:23,926 --> 00:12:24,927
A deadly massage technique?

153
00:12:28,694 --> 00:12:31,080
What the hell? Like in those Chinese martial arts movies?

154
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:35,160
That's fucking ridiculous!

155
00:12:36,694 --> 00:12:39,200
Moo, take me to those bastards!

156
00:12:46,174 --> 00:12:47,715
If you do anything to them, sir,

157
00:12:48,110 --> 00:12:50,440
the upcoming party leadership election will be in jeopardy.

158
00:12:51,672 --> 00:12:55,760
But if those bastards are still alive and expose me, it'll be just as bad!

159
00:12:56,451 --> 00:12:58,200
We each have our own goals.

160
00:12:59,998 --> 00:13:01,840
The prime minister position you're after

161
00:13:02,312 --> 00:13:04,640
is no different from my desire to find Korn.

162
00:13:05,235 --> 00:13:06,760
Once I become prime minister,

163
00:13:07,139 --> 00:13:10,760
I can call black white, and no one will dare contradict me.

164
00:13:11,267 --> 00:13:13,000
And you'll benefit from that, too.

165
00:13:13,822 --> 00:13:16,062
If I get the deadly massage manual from Korn,

166
00:13:17,659 --> 00:13:21,080
I can help you eliminate your political rivals.

167
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,401
And becoming prime minister

168
00:13:23,942 --> 00:13:25,200
will be much easier for you.

169
00:13:29,323 --> 00:13:30,324
Fine.

170
00:13:31,259 --> 00:13:34,520
I'll give you until the party leadership election. No longer.

171
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:39,320
And once that day comes, I won't let any fucking bastard stand in my way!

172
00:13:42,907 --> 00:13:45,008
Whatever you're planning, you'd better hurry.

173
00:13:46,443 --> 00:13:48,400
His daughter looks like she's not one to mess with.

174
00:13:49,256 --> 00:13:50,920
She'll be coming to rescue her father soon.

175
00:13:54,776 --> 00:13:56,250
I'll be waiting for her.

176
00:13:58,755 --> 00:13:59,756
Call Muk.

177
00:14:00,648 --> 00:14:02,160
Ask if Korn has been acting suspiciously.

178
00:14:03,763 --> 00:14:05,040
Muk isn't keeping an eye on him, sir.

179
00:14:07,971 --> 00:14:08,972
Where did Muk go?

180
00:14:09,198 --> 00:14:11,399
Called in sick. Said he had a doctor's appointment.

181
00:14:20,694 --> 00:14:22,720
Arokaya is actually a gambling den?

182
00:14:25,622 --> 00:14:27,320
Is there any way we can expose them?

183
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,720
Like sneaking in, filming them, and posting it on social media?

184
00:14:29,782 --> 00:14:33,000
Then people online could pressure the authorities to investigate Arokaya.

185
00:14:33,622 --> 00:14:36,200
Or should we approach Mr. Krit's political rivals

186
00:14:36,822 --> 00:14:38,240
and get them to do something about it?

187
00:14:42,382 --> 00:14:45,440
Wan, now I'm jealous!

188
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,101
You invited a girl over here?

189
00:15:00,214 --> 00:15:01,215
You don't have to leave.

190
00:15:04,608 --> 00:15:05,760
I won't tell Master Tim.

191
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:10,281
I came alone.

192
00:15:12,291 --> 00:15:14,000
Master Tim doesn't know I came to see you.

193
00:15:15,539 --> 00:15:18,360
I told Muk to let me know if anything happened.

194
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:24,680
If I help you find your father and bring him back,

195
00:15:28,094 --> 00:15:29,320
will you help me?

196
00:15:32,104 --> 00:15:33,105
What do you need help with?

197
00:15:41,776 --> 00:15:43,400
I'll go get some first-aid supplies for you.

198
00:15:51,766 --> 00:15:53,960
Master Tim is obsessed with the deadly massage technique.

199
00:15:55,584 --> 00:15:57,574
At first, he wasn't even sure it existed.

200
00:15:59,630 --> 00:16:00,920
So he just...

201
00:16:02,531 --> 00:16:03,960
kept searching for it.

202
00:16:06,926 --> 00:16:08,440
But once he heard about it from you,

203
00:16:11,523 --> 00:16:12,840
he became even more violent.

204
00:16:19,854 --> 00:16:21,300
Then why do you put up with it?

205
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,360
Master Tim took me in off the streets.

206
00:16:33,331 --> 00:16:35,200
I look up to him like a father.

207
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:38,814
No child would dare speak up

208
00:16:40,739 --> 00:16:42,440
about what their father has done to them.

209
00:16:46,904 --> 00:16:50,880
I know that if I keep putting up with this,

210
00:16:53,323 --> 00:16:55,320
I'll end up as nothing more than a practice dummy for his deadly massage technique.

211
00:16:58,955 --> 00:16:59,956
I'm scared.

212
00:17:11,099 --> 00:17:12,100
Stay with me.

213
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:13,840
You don't have to go back.

214
00:17:14,592 --> 00:17:15,640
But Master Tim...

215
00:17:17,462 --> 00:17:18,700
You've already endured enough

216
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,300
to repay everything he's done for you.

217
00:17:24,662 --> 00:17:26,160
If you want me to help you,

218
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,300
you have to learn to love yourself first.

219
00:18:16,304 --> 00:18:18,000
This is an old ice factory owned by my father's friend.

220
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,280
Hattha and I have been hiding out here.

221
00:18:20,561 --> 00:18:23,640
It's close to home, and Master Tim would never think to look here.

222
00:18:25,264 --> 00:18:28,400
I ran away from Master Tim.

223
00:18:28,784 --> 00:18:30,470
I didn't bring anything with me.

224
00:18:30,950 --> 00:18:33,500
I was afraid he'd find out.

225
00:18:33,707 --> 00:18:36,400
It's okay. You can use my things for now.

226
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:37,411
You can borrow my clothes, too.

227
00:18:38,251 --> 00:18:40,280
Then I'll take you shopping for essentials tomorrow.

228
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,000
- Are you hungry?
- Yes.

229
00:18:47,464 --> 00:18:49,880
I'll go see what we have in the kitchen.

230
00:18:52,208 --> 00:18:53,209
After you.

231
00:19:12,038 --> 00:19:13,100
Would you like some sausages?

232
00:19:13,811 --> 00:19:14,812
Let's add some sausages.

233
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:18,761
(Master Tim)

234
00:19:28,936 --> 00:19:29,937
It's Master Tim.

235
00:19:31,752 --> 00:19:33,840
He probably knows by now that I've run away.

236
00:19:34,664 --> 00:19:35,760
Actually, I'm glad he found out.

237
00:19:36,024 --> 00:19:38,952
He needs to know he's not God and can't control everyone's life.

238
00:19:43,806 --> 00:19:45,840
So what's your plan

239
00:19:46,302 --> 00:19:48,000
to rescue your father?

240
00:19:49,235 --> 00:19:50,720
Master Tim knows you're coming.

241
00:19:51,134 --> 00:19:52,776
He's already prepared for your arrival.

242
00:19:53,475 --> 00:19:54,720
We're still figuring it out.

243
00:19:55,752 --> 00:19:58,750
But Ya said the VIP floor is guarded and covered by CCTV cameras.

244
00:19:59,150 --> 00:20:02,360
Phat could handle all those guards on his own.

245
00:20:07,782 --> 00:20:09,300
We're doing this without him.

246
00:20:18,819 --> 00:20:21,120
I don't know what happened between you two,

247
00:20:22,371 --> 00:20:25,640
but if you're planning to sneak into Arokaya and rescue someone,

248
00:20:26,619 --> 00:20:28,160
you'll definitely need his help.

249
00:21:04,966 --> 00:21:06,250
Hello? I need a favor.

250
00:21:09,291 --> 00:21:10,292
Hello?

251
00:21:26,990 --> 00:21:27,991
What do you need?

252
00:21:28,536 --> 00:21:29,560
It's about your father, isn't it?

253
00:21:31,251 --> 00:21:32,880
If you're uncomfortable helping, you don't have to.

254
00:21:33,528 --> 00:21:35,000
Did I say I was uncomfortable?

255
00:21:38,216 --> 00:21:39,217
Let's talk at home.

256
00:21:41,747 --> 00:21:42,748
Hop on.

257
00:22:21,672 --> 00:22:22,673
Thank you.

258
00:22:29,475 --> 00:22:32,902
By the time you sneak in, get the footage, and post it online,

259
00:22:33,104 --> 00:22:35,640
it'll take days for the public pressure to build up.

260
00:22:36,363 --> 00:22:37,600
Are you afraid I'll expose your father?

261
00:22:38,112 --> 00:22:39,113
Hattha.

262
00:22:40,363 --> 00:22:42,364
If I were, I wouldn't be sitting here.

263
00:22:43,894 --> 00:22:45,400
Then what's the plan?

264
00:22:46,550 --> 00:22:48,880
If we can't get in, we'll have to lure them out.

265
00:22:49,515 --> 00:22:51,960
Arokaya's alarm system is extremely sensitive.

266
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:55,680
If we trigger the smoke detectors,

267
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:57,500
the alarm will go off.

268
00:22:57,982 --> 00:23:00,040
All the automatic doors will open.

269
00:23:00,462 --> 00:23:02,600
Everyone will panic, including the people in the gambling den.

270
00:23:02,998 --> 00:23:05,480
Anyone carrying chips, cash, or guns

271
00:23:06,040 --> 00:23:07,041
will be exposed.

272
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:10,960
Then we'll use the chaos

273
00:23:11,254 --> 00:23:12,600
to rescue your father.

274
00:23:13,582 --> 00:23:16,183
If the plan fails, they might move your father somewhere else.

275
00:23:16,203 --> 00:23:17,524
Do you really think I'm that stupid?

276
00:23:17,763 --> 00:23:18,764
Hattha.

277
00:23:19,987 --> 00:23:21,700
Phat's only warning you because he's worried about you.

278
00:23:22,403 --> 00:23:24,800
If Master Tim moves our father somewhere else,

279
00:23:25,128 --> 00:23:26,480
it'll be even harder for us to rescue him.

280
00:23:27,294 --> 00:23:29,180
We might not even get a second chance.

281
00:23:32,771 --> 00:23:35,550
We can't work together if you still don't trust me.

282
00:23:45,011 --> 00:23:46,240
Can I talk to you for a minute?

283
00:24:15,174 --> 00:24:17,800
I only found out my father killed your mother when you told me.

284
00:24:28,854 --> 00:24:30,520
This is grown-up business. Go to bed.

285
00:24:43,427 --> 00:24:44,920
And everything I've done

286
00:24:45,792 --> 00:24:48,000
was because I wanted to make it up to you on his behalf.

287
00:24:50,283 --> 00:24:51,284
So you're finally admitting it?

288
00:24:57,419 --> 00:24:59,560
I just want to feel less guilty about my father.

289
00:25:02,368 --> 00:25:03,369
Guilty about what?

290
00:25:10,187 --> 00:25:11,250
My father and I

291
00:25:13,856 --> 00:25:14,960
were never close.

292
00:25:17,835 --> 00:25:18,840
When I was little,

293
00:25:19,846 --> 00:25:22,840
he wouldn't let my mother and me move to Phuket to live with him.

294
00:25:24,038 --> 00:25:27,280
He said he was worried about our safety.

295
00:25:29,136 --> 00:25:31,040
Until my eighth birthday,

296
00:25:31,867 --> 00:25:33,800
when my mother took me to Phuket to surprise him.

297
00:25:37,392 --> 00:25:38,393
Uh... Phat.

298
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:42,501
Hi.

299
00:25:45,416 --> 00:25:46,880
Well? Are you surprised?

300
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:48,640
Yes, I am.

301
00:25:48,974 --> 00:25:52,360
Happy birthday to you.

302
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:56,000
Happy birthday to you.

303
00:25:56,576 --> 00:26:00,600
Happy birthday, happy birthday.

304
00:26:00,654 --> 00:26:04,640
Happy birthday to you.

305
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,960
[Marriage Certificate]

306
00:26:30,430 --> 00:26:32,979
- Dad... Dad, come here!
- Dad, don't go!

307
00:26:33,646 --> 00:26:34,647
Dad!

308
00:26:35,512 --> 00:26:38,560
Come on, don't hit him. Stop it, son.

309
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,201
Phat!

310
00:26:43,886 --> 00:26:44,887
Are you okay?

311
00:26:47,998 --> 00:26:48,999
We'll talk later.

312
00:27:15,390 --> 00:27:17,720
Hey, have you seen my money? It blew this way.

313
00:27:18,232 --> 00:27:19,233
No, I haven't.

314
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:26,160
That was the day we met on the beach.

315
00:27:30,403 --> 00:27:33,000
I'm sorry, but how did your mother get into a car accident?

316
00:27:34,982 --> 00:27:37,520
When I found out the truth about my father,

317
00:27:41,280 --> 00:27:42,650
I was angry at everyone in the world.

318
00:27:45,352 --> 00:27:47,880
And I wanted them to know how much I was hurting.

319
00:27:51,475 --> 00:27:53,200
So I stole my mother's money and ran away.

320
00:28:03,310 --> 00:28:05,760
She went looking for me and got into an accident.

321
00:28:20,776 --> 00:28:21,777
After that,

322
00:28:23,520 --> 00:28:26,221
my father sent me to live with my uncle, who worked as his hitman.

323
00:28:33,300 --> 00:28:34,301
What about Dad?

324
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:35,960
Just stay here with me.

325
00:28:36,419 --> 00:28:38,460
Behave yourself, and maybe your dad will love you.

326
00:28:42,611 --> 00:28:43,612
He was sick.

327
00:28:43,723 --> 00:28:45,640
And he knew he didn't have much time left.

328
00:28:47,520 --> 00:28:50,360
So he raised me to take his place.

329
00:28:51,926 --> 00:28:52,927
Harder!

330
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,001
Yeah!

331
00:28:55,851 --> 00:28:58,300
Come on! I said harder! Faster!

332
00:28:58,406 --> 00:29:00,600
Good! Faster! Keep going!

333
00:29:01,494 --> 00:29:02,495
Faster!

334
00:29:04,107 --> 00:29:05,108
Come on!

335
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:09,840
I grew up feeling guilty

336
00:29:13,664 --> 00:29:14,920
for causing my mother's death.

337
00:29:21,038 --> 00:29:23,039
And my uncle kept telling me every day

338
00:29:33,118 --> 00:29:35,480
that if I wanted my father to love me, I had to obey him.

339
00:29:42,950 --> 00:29:45,240
And there were my mother's last words to me.

340
00:29:46,846 --> 00:29:48,680
My son, Patrick.

341
00:29:49,774 --> 00:29:50,880
Stay with Dad.

342
00:29:51,768 --> 00:29:53,350
Listen to him.

343
00:29:58,230 --> 00:29:59,231
Mom!

344
00:29:59,696 --> 00:30:00,697
Mom!

345
00:30:08,422 --> 00:30:09,723
I'm so sorry for your loss.

346
00:30:11,488 --> 00:30:12,689
Mom!

347
00:30:13,560 --> 00:30:14,640
Mom!

348
00:30:15,598 --> 00:30:16,824
Mom!

349
00:30:17,854 --> 00:30:19,300
Your mother was worried about you.

350
00:30:21,363 --> 00:30:23,300
That's why she drove out to look for you.

351
00:30:25,486 --> 00:30:26,560
Otherwise, she'd still be...

352
00:30:27,630 --> 00:30:30,280
Dad, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

353
00:30:31,731 --> 00:30:32,732
Hey!

354
00:30:43,048 --> 00:30:44,649
I knew what I was doing was wrong.

355
00:30:46,608 --> 00:30:47,880
But I didn't care.

356
00:30:49,936 --> 00:30:51,560
Because the only thing I wanted

357
00:30:52,700 --> 00:30:54,701
was for my father to forgive me.

358
00:30:58,206 --> 00:31:00,520
So I did everything he told me to do.

359
00:31:12,496 --> 00:31:13,700
Until I met you.

360
00:31:19,494 --> 00:31:21,080
I'm not that important.

361
00:31:24,406 --> 00:31:25,407
Yes, you are.

362
00:31:29,224 --> 00:31:30,800
I kept the truth about my father from you,

363
00:31:33,700 --> 00:31:35,320
but I never lied to you.

364
00:31:40,195 --> 00:31:42,240
And the reason I wanted you to give up your revenge

365
00:31:45,272 --> 00:31:47,600
was because I genuinely wanted you to go back to your father.

366
00:31:52,019 --> 00:31:54,360
You still have a father waiting to hold you in his arms.

367
00:31:58,867 --> 00:31:59,880
But I don't.

368
00:32:02,750 --> 00:32:05,440
And I don't even know if I'll ever have that before I die.

369
00:32:12,728 --> 00:32:13,729
I'm sorry.

370
00:32:25,302 --> 00:32:26,930
My father has never forgiven me.

371
00:32:32,339 --> 00:32:34,000
But you'll forgive me, won't you?

372
00:32:54,598 --> 00:32:55,880
I'm ordering you to kill her!

373
00:32:56,896 --> 00:32:58,340
And you're going to do it right now!

374
00:32:59,024 --> 00:33:00,400
Kill that bitch right now!

375
00:33:20,832 --> 00:33:21,960
If you won't do it,

376
00:33:22,939 --> 00:33:24,120
I'll kill her myself!

377
00:33:27,664 --> 00:33:28,800
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

378
00:33:33,227 --> 00:33:34,320
I love Hattha.

379
00:33:38,182 --> 00:33:39,183
Leave her alone.

380
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,720
[Teeranasakul Residence]

381
00:35:04,397 --> 00:35:07,520
Yesterday, Mr. Narong played golf with Secretary Chukiat.

382
00:35:12,102 --> 00:35:13,440
So that means

383
00:35:15,275 --> 00:35:17,100
Chukiat has already picked a side.

384
00:35:17,926 --> 00:35:19,300
What does Narong's team have to say?

385
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,080
They're digging up information on you, sir.

386
00:35:22,771 --> 00:35:24,595
But we've already taken precautions.

387
00:35:24,798 --> 00:35:25,840
I assure you,

388
00:35:25,971 --> 00:35:28,480
nothing they could use against you

389
00:35:28,678 --> 00:35:29,920
will ever get leaked.

390
00:35:37,926 --> 00:35:38,927
You never know.

391
00:35:41,968 --> 00:35:43,920
I'm going to elevate traditional Thai healing

392
00:35:44,592 --> 00:35:47,600
into a premium wellness identity.

393
00:35:49,062 --> 00:35:53,120
It's an intellectual legacy passed down from our ancestors.

394
00:35:54,120 --> 00:35:56,221
And I'll make sure it earns a place on the world stage.

395
00:35:58,083 --> 00:35:59,800
- Do you know how I'm going to do that?
- How, sir?

396
00:36:00,952 --> 00:36:03,360
By looking beyond just tourists.

397
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:07,720
I'm targeting multinational corporations.

398
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:11,760
Because they have enormous purchasing power.

399
00:36:12,387 --> 00:36:14,595
And that enormous purchasing power

400
00:36:15,064 --> 00:36:18,880
will also help boost Thailand's grassroots economy

401
00:36:19,200 --> 00:36:21,960
to new heights.

402
00:36:30,550 --> 00:36:34,480
Hey, everyone! Today, I am taking you to check out a chic new spot!

403
00:36:34,619 --> 00:36:37,360
And the atmosphere here is amazing, everyone!

404
00:36:37,398 --> 00:36:39,080
- Exactly!
- It's gorgeous!

405
00:36:39,472 --> 00:36:41,600
Welcome to Arokaya Land!

406
00:36:44,670 --> 00:36:46,640
I'm telling you, everyone,

407
00:36:46,671 --> 00:36:48,760
this place is huge and absolutely stunning!

408
00:36:48,814 --> 00:36:50,880
And it's got everything you could possibly need.

409
00:36:50,900 --> 00:36:54,240
From a movie theater to cafés, they've got it all!

410
00:36:54,371 --> 00:36:57,080
And if you love massages, you're in for a treat!

411
00:36:57,102 --> 00:37:00,080
- Because massages are their specialty here!
- Let's go!

412
00:37:00,470 --> 00:37:01,471
Come on!

413
00:37:33,182 --> 00:37:37,000
And this is Master Tim, an expert in traditional Thai massage.

414
00:37:37,053 --> 00:37:39,523
He's the man behind Arokaya Land.

415
00:37:39,592 --> 00:37:42,440
First of all, we'd like to thank Master Tim

416
00:37:42,450 --> 00:37:44,400
for taking the time to speak with us today.

417
00:37:44,451 --> 00:37:45,840
Thank you.

418
00:37:47,075 --> 00:37:48,076
Okay.

419
00:37:49,368 --> 00:37:50,600
Thank you, Master Tim.

420
00:37:50,931 --> 00:37:54,120
I'll send you the video as soon as we've finished editing it.

421
00:37:54,526 --> 00:37:58,050
But I haven't been able to reach your assistant, Muk.

422
00:37:58,493 --> 00:37:59,800
Who should I contact instead?

423
00:38:00,830 --> 00:38:02,920
I'll have someone else get in touch with you.

424
00:38:03,680 --> 00:38:04,681
Muk is on sick leave.

425
00:38:04,769 --> 00:38:06,320
Oh, I see.

426
00:38:50,152 --> 00:38:52,132
- Found anything yet?
- Not yet, Master Tim.

427
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,571
The smoke detector has been triggered, Master Tim.

428
00:39:15,801 --> 00:39:16,802
But we haven't found the source yet.

429
00:39:19,632 --> 00:39:20,720
They're here.

430
00:39:26,086 --> 00:39:27,808
Oh my God, there's a fire! Let's get out of here!

431
00:39:28,198 --> 00:39:30,360
Wait! My livestream views are skyrocketing!

432
00:39:30,416 --> 00:39:32,350
Who cares? Let's get out of here! Hurry!

433
00:39:49,656 --> 00:39:50,657
Hey! Stop filming!

434
00:39:50,700 --> 00:39:52,000
Look! What are those chips?

435
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:55,041
Everyone, are you seeing what I'm seeing?

436
00:40:15,014 --> 00:40:16,615
Shit! What if Master Tim has already moved our fathers?

437
00:40:17,406 --> 00:40:18,920
Maybe he took them through the VIP exit.

438
00:40:24,451 --> 00:40:25,452
Come here!

439
00:40:27,784 --> 00:40:28,785
Get in!

440
00:40:37,048 --> 00:40:38,049
Where are Korn and the others?

441
00:40:41,928 --> 00:40:44,500
I asked you where the hell they are!

442
00:40:45,992 --> 00:40:47,250
I don't know, Master Tim.

443
00:40:47,704 --> 00:40:49,700
I thought you'd already taken them out.

444
00:40:50,254 --> 00:40:52,900
Check the CCTV footage! Find out who took them!

445
00:41:00,443 --> 00:41:01,520
Go! Get in the car!

446
00:41:04,166 --> 00:41:05,480
Hurry!

447
00:41:12,515 --> 00:41:15,640
- Hey! Uncle! Dad!
- Hattha, calm down! Calm down!

448
00:41:26,635 --> 00:41:27,636
Where the hell have you been?

449
00:41:31,369 --> 00:41:33,370
Where have you been?

450
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:35,840
Let me go, Master Tim.

451
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:40,280
I just want to live a normal life.

452
00:41:41,039 --> 00:41:42,040
Your life

453
00:41:44,115 --> 00:41:45,320
belongs to me.

454
00:41:47,712 --> 00:41:48,880
Have you forgotten that?

455
00:41:54,182 --> 00:41:55,183
Come here!

456
00:41:57,539 --> 00:41:59,640
Master Tim, you're hurting me!

457
00:42:06,200 --> 00:42:09,320
Stop being such a psycho, Master Tim! Muk said no, and she means it!

458
00:42:09,750 --> 00:42:10,751
Go!

459
00:42:26,886 --> 00:42:29,250
There's no way you can overpower those bodyguards.

460
00:42:29,843 --> 00:42:32,640
Your only chance is precision.

461
00:42:37,843 --> 00:42:40,570
Apply steady pressure to cut off blood flow to the brain.

462
00:42:41,336 --> 00:42:42,520
The body will shut down,

463
00:42:43,219 --> 00:42:44,800
and they'll quietly lose consciousness.

464
00:42:53,326 --> 00:42:54,840
Muk! Muk, hurry!

465
00:42:59,390 --> 00:43:00,391
But remember,

466
00:43:00,720 --> 00:43:01,760
you have to keep your fingers steady.

467
00:43:02,547 --> 00:43:04,320
If your hand shakes or you miss even slightly,

468
00:43:05,150 --> 00:43:06,920
they'll turn around and attack you immediately.

469
00:43:47,862 --> 00:43:50,560
Wan, I'm following the car that took our father.

470
00:43:51,054 --> 00:43:54,040
Master Tim struck Muk in the back with his cane.

471
00:43:54,179 --> 00:43:55,180
She's probably having trouble breathing.

472
00:43:55,315 --> 00:43:56,700
How is Muk doing?

473
00:43:57,086 --> 00:43:58,387
Is Muk okay?

474
00:43:58,960 --> 00:44:02,200
I'm okay. I'm just a little winded.

475
00:44:03,064 --> 00:44:04,065
Then...

476
00:44:04,734 --> 00:44:06,000
Wan, take Muk home.

477
00:44:06,200 --> 00:44:08,760
And gently massage her neck and shoulders along the way.

478
00:44:08,899 --> 00:44:10,700
But don't press randomly. Let Muk guide you to the right spots.

479
00:44:10,987 --> 00:44:14,560
And Muk, gently press the points below your collarbones from time to time.

480
00:44:14,582 --> 00:44:16,250
I'll come as soon as I've rescued my father.

481
00:44:16,683 --> 00:44:18,040
Okay, I will.

482
00:44:18,560 --> 00:44:19,561
Okay, Hattha.

483
00:44:48,438 --> 00:44:49,439
Hey, hurry up!

484
00:44:55,963 --> 00:44:56,964
Go!

485
00:44:59,462 --> 00:45:00,463
Go!

486
00:45:10,912 --> 00:45:11,913
That's strange.

487
00:45:12,363 --> 00:45:15,564
These are my father's men who were sent to infiltrate Arokaya.

488
00:45:16,582 --> 00:45:18,100
Why are they involved with your fathers?

489
00:45:19,184 --> 00:45:21,840
- I don't care who they are. I'm saving my father!
- Wait!

490
00:45:41,891 --> 00:45:42,892
Let go!

491
00:45:55,000 --> 00:45:56,001
In, are you okay?

492
00:45:56,886 --> 00:45:58,200
I'm okay. How about you?

493
00:46:06,240 --> 00:46:07,241
Mr. Krit!

494
00:46:22,038 --> 00:46:23,039
Dad!

495
00:46:23,920 --> 00:46:25,721
I thought you'd died back then.

496
00:46:29,707 --> 00:46:30,880
You've got quite a capable daughter.

497
00:46:31,500 --> 00:46:32,801
You've met Hattha before?

498
00:46:33,192 --> 00:46:34,193
Of course.

499
00:46:35,240 --> 00:46:36,241
Many times, in fact.

500
00:46:40,451 --> 00:46:41,452
- Dad!
- Wait!

501
00:46:42,062 --> 00:46:43,063
Dad!

502
00:46:43,123 --> 00:46:44,360
- Hattha!
- Hattha!

503
00:46:46,900 --> 00:46:47,901
Dad!

504
00:46:48,376 --> 00:46:49,800
He's the flatfoot bastard who killed Mom!

505
00:46:52,150 --> 00:46:53,151
The flatfoot bastard?

506
00:46:59,014 --> 00:47:00,015
Is that true, sir?

507
00:47:17,304 --> 00:47:18,840
You killed my son too, didn't you?

508
00:47:24,696 --> 00:47:27,600
Your son was hired to be a scapegoat.

509
00:47:29,979 --> 00:47:31,980
I just helped him finish the job.

510
00:47:35,155 --> 00:47:36,640
You're a fucking monster!

511
00:47:37,550 --> 00:47:38,551
Hattha, watch out!

512
00:47:39,982 --> 00:47:40,983
Hattha!

513
00:47:43,376 --> 00:47:44,377
Hattha!

514
00:47:48,283 --> 00:47:49,760
The boss ordered us to kill everyone.

515
00:48:25,147 --> 00:48:26,440
Go! Hurry!

516
00:48:27,800 --> 00:48:28,801
Hurry!

517
00:48:30,614 --> 00:48:31,720
- Go!
- Phat!

518
00:48:31,872 --> 00:48:32,873
Hurry!

519
00:48:33,200 --> 00:48:34,201
Phat!

520
00:48:42,000 --> 00:48:43,001
Hey…

521
00:48:43,230 --> 00:48:44,231
The knife!

522
00:48:52,987 --> 00:48:53,988
Come on, let me help.

523
00:49:00,760 --> 00:49:02,400
- Wait! The wheel's come off!
- What?

524
00:49:04,104 --> 00:49:06,400
Leave it! We'll never escape in this thing! Go!

525
00:49:06,968 --> 00:49:07,969
Keep quiet.

526
00:49:08,931 --> 00:49:10,130
Uncle, let's rest here for a bit.

527
00:49:18,067 --> 00:49:21,200
Doctor, my car's over there. The keys are in my pocket.

528
00:49:28,910 --> 00:49:31,520
Being around those bastards has made your life a living hell!

529
00:49:31,680 --> 00:49:33,240
You have to kill those bastards! Let me go!

530
00:49:34,700 --> 00:49:37,300
From now on, I won't blindly follow your orders if they don't make sense.

531
00:49:37,456 --> 00:49:39,057
What the fuck do you mean, they don't make sense?

532
00:49:39,240 --> 00:49:41,360
If those bastards are still alive, I'll never become party leader!

533
00:49:41,742 --> 00:49:44,600
Then I guess you're out of luck. You've got plenty more dirty secrets to hide.

534
00:49:44,697 --> 00:49:47,720
I've kept them hidden all this time. And today, I'll get rid of you all, too.

535
00:49:48,432 --> 00:49:49,817
Please let them go, Dad.

536
00:49:50,200 --> 00:49:51,320
Just let them go.

537
00:49:54,848 --> 00:49:56,315
So now you dare defy my orders?

538
00:49:59,510 --> 00:50:00,960
I just don't want you to do anything wrong again.

539
00:50:01,243 --> 00:50:02,244
What the fuck is wrong with that?

540
00:50:03,317 --> 00:50:04,800
Letting those bastards live would be the real mistake!

541
00:50:07,190 --> 00:50:09,302
You're just as fucking useless as your mother!

542
00:50:13,467 --> 00:50:14,600
Leave Mom out of this!

543
00:50:16,822 --> 00:50:18,280
Your mother was the worst of them all!

544
00:50:19,744 --> 00:50:20,960
But I really have to thank you.

545
00:50:21,248 --> 00:50:22,960
If you hadn't run away from home that night,

546
00:50:23,579 --> 00:50:26,140
I wouldn't have known where your mother's brakes would fail.

547
00:50:42,539 --> 00:50:43,560
Mom's brakes failed?

548
00:50:52,720 --> 00:50:53,960
Did you do that?

549
00:51:05,051 --> 00:51:06,052
Why?

550
00:51:08,016 --> 00:51:09,440
Why did you have to kill Mom?

551
00:51:13,752 --> 00:51:17,440
Because she was going to betray me, just like you're doing now!

552
00:51:19,651 --> 00:51:21,400
That bitch demanded I leave my wife.

553
00:51:22,000 --> 00:51:23,601
Or she'd expose me for taking bribes.

554
00:51:25,278 --> 00:51:26,360
Can you believe that shit?

555
00:51:29,368 --> 00:51:30,800
She fucking deserved to die!

556
00:51:38,651 --> 00:51:40,720
What the fuck is taking them so long?

557
00:51:44,771 --> 00:51:46,440
Did you ever love Mom and me?

558
00:51:57,563 --> 00:51:59,080
Whether I love you or not doesn't matter.

559
00:52:00,784 --> 00:52:02,400
But your mother loved you very much.

560
00:52:06,747 --> 00:52:09,520
And thanks to you, I managed to get rid of her, you little bastard!

561
00:52:18,432 --> 00:52:19,926
If you're going to shoot me, do it!

562
00:52:20,768 --> 00:52:21,769
Go ahead! Shoot me!

563
00:52:35,448 --> 00:52:36,640
- You bastard!
- Phat!

564
00:52:46,678 --> 00:52:47,680
You're the real bastard!

565
00:52:48,472 --> 00:52:50,080
I'm lucky I don't have a father like you!

566
00:52:50,766 --> 00:52:52,240
You don't want me to shoot Phat?

567
00:52:52,920 --> 00:52:54,520
Then I'll shoot your father first!

568
00:52:57,334 --> 00:52:58,335
Hattha, don't!

569
00:53:05,656 --> 00:53:08,083
Is this that bullshit deadly massage technique of yours?

570
00:53:16,190 --> 00:53:17,191
Hattha!

571
00:53:17,619 --> 00:53:19,000
Go get the gun, Minkheng!

572
00:53:20,467 --> 00:53:21,920
Where are you going? Where the hell are you going?

573
00:53:26,790 --> 00:53:27,791
You little shit!

574
00:53:29,904 --> 00:53:31,360
Hattha, press his neck!

575
00:53:31,515 --> 00:53:32,516
Press his neck!

576
00:53:36,382 --> 00:53:37,383
Harder!

577
00:53:40,150 --> 00:53:41,200
Harder! Put more pressure on it!

578
00:53:41,798 --> 00:53:42,799
Good!

579
00:53:42,968 --> 00:53:45,480
Phat, help me!

580
00:53:45,700 --> 00:53:46,701
Hattha!

581
00:53:47,701 --> 00:53:48,802
I was just trying to stop him.

582
00:53:59,494 --> 00:54:00,495
You little bitch!

583
00:54:31,378 --> 00:54:32,379
Drop your weapons!

584
00:54:39,598 --> 00:54:41,700
Inn, we're safe now.

585
00:54:42,696 --> 00:54:43,697
The police are here.

586
00:54:46,254 --> 00:54:47,255
Shit!

587
00:54:54,200 --> 00:54:55,201
Hey.

588
00:55:03,779 --> 00:55:06,840
Master Tim reported that you deliberately caused a disturbance

589
00:55:07,200 --> 00:55:09,100
and damaged Arokaya's property.

590
00:55:09,290 --> 00:55:10,720
You'd better surrender peacefully.

591
00:55:11,275 --> 00:55:14,360
We're the ones Master Tim held captive!

592
00:55:14,832 --> 00:55:16,500
Master Tim is the one who should be arrested!

593
00:55:17,317 --> 00:55:18,520
Don't be stubborn, Inn.

594
00:55:19,990 --> 00:55:21,920
They came all this way to ask you nicely.

595
00:55:23,392 --> 00:55:25,120
So you'd better go quietly.

596
00:55:26,832 --> 00:55:28,040
Let's not make things difficult for everyone.

597
00:55:28,950 --> 00:55:31,760
And these are the cops we're supposed to rely on?

598
00:55:32,619 --> 00:55:33,880
You're nothing but thugs in uniform!

599
00:55:34,640 --> 00:55:35,641
You little shit!

600
00:55:37,238 --> 00:55:38,239
Let go!

601
00:55:39,814 --> 00:55:40,840
Let me go! Let go!

602
00:55:41,046 --> 00:55:42,047
Come here!

603
00:55:46,539 --> 00:55:48,560
So, you think you're good at massage, huh?

604
00:55:49,515 --> 00:55:50,516
Don't!

605
00:55:53,344 --> 00:55:57,560
Stay still! Mind your own fucking business, you little bastard!

606
00:55:58,758 --> 00:56:00,400
What about this side? This one too, right?

607
00:56:03,798 --> 00:56:04,810
That's enough!

608
00:56:06,758 --> 00:56:10,520
I told you not to touch Korn or his daughter yet!

609
00:56:13,739 --> 00:56:15,200
You still haven't given up, Master Tim?

610
00:56:15,392 --> 00:56:18,800
What's with your obsession with that ridiculous deadly massage technique?

611
00:56:20,278 --> 00:56:22,960
It's fucking absurd!

612
00:56:29,422 --> 00:56:30,423
Hey!

613
00:56:31,112 --> 00:56:33,250
I think it's time to end this, massage therapist.

614
00:56:51,438 --> 00:56:52,439
Dad!

615
00:56:59,859 --> 00:57:00,860
Dad!

616
00:57:03,670 --> 00:57:04,671
Dad!

617
00:57:05,032 --> 00:57:06,033
Dad!

618
00:57:06,035 --> 00:57:07,036
Dad!

619
00:57:08,014 --> 00:57:09,440
You little...

620
00:57:13,326 --> 00:57:14,327
Dad!

621
00:57:14,990 --> 00:57:15,991
Dad!

622
00:57:19,779 --> 00:57:20,780
Dad!

623
00:57:32,780 --> 00:57:34,320
Hand over the manual already!

624
00:57:35,670 --> 00:57:37,560
I'll give it to you once everyone is safe.

625
00:57:38,910 --> 00:57:40,100
If you don't give it to me,

626
00:57:42,339 --> 00:57:44,720
every last one of you will die here!

627
00:57:52,424 --> 00:57:54,040
- Uncle!
- Dad!

628
00:57:54,638 --> 00:57:55,880
Hand over the manual!

629
00:57:59,336 --> 00:58:00,337
Give it to me now!

630
00:58:01,523 --> 00:58:02,524
Tim, don't! Please, Tim!

631
00:58:06,979 --> 00:58:08,360
Tim, don't! Tim!

632
00:58:08,883 --> 00:58:09,884
Here, take it!

633
00:58:34,291 --> 00:58:35,600
This damn manual

634
00:58:36,840 --> 00:58:38,320
is between you and me.

635
00:58:40,125 --> 00:58:41,320
No one else is involved.

636
00:58:43,038 --> 00:58:44,320
Whatever you want to know,

637
00:58:46,339 --> 00:58:48,440
I'll tell you everything.

638
00:58:49,664 --> 00:58:51,000
But on one condition.

639
00:58:52,438 --> 00:58:55,120
You have to let everyone go.

640
00:58:55,851 --> 00:58:58,080
You're in no position to bargain with me!

641
00:58:58,528 --> 00:58:59,529
You hear me?

642
00:59:06,475 --> 00:59:08,000
- Hey!
- Dad!

643
00:59:08,043 --> 00:59:10,044
- Don't do it!
- Dad, put the gun down!

644
00:59:10,464 --> 00:59:11,465
Go ahead. Try me.

645
00:59:12,832 --> 00:59:13,960
Without me,

646
00:59:15,462 --> 00:59:18,960
