647
00:59:20,731 --> 00:59:22,176
The choice is yours.

648
00:59:22,283 --> 00:59:23,920
Dad, don't!

649
00:59:24,598 --> 00:59:27,840
- What's it going to be, Tim?
- Dad!

650
00:59:28,262 --> 00:59:29,263
Well?

651
00:59:30,606 --> 00:59:31,607
Make your choice.

652
00:59:55,150 --> 00:59:58,100
Master Tim has the deadly massage manual now.
I don't know what he'll do to Dad.

653
00:59:58,723 --> 00:59:59,760
Then let's go rescue Uncle Korn.

654
01:00:00,568 --> 01:00:02,240
Let's use the evidence to expose him.

655
01:00:02,851 --> 01:00:04,640
Master Tim! The place is swarming with cops!

656
01:00:06,877 --> 01:00:08,920
Your daughter and that bastard Phat

657
01:00:09,208 --> 01:00:10,520
have ruined everything for me!

658
01:00:11,080 --> 01:00:12,081
You

659
01:00:12,950 --> 01:00:15,240
are going to pay for what your daughter did!

660
01:00:16,123 --> 01:00:18,240
I'll burn her father alive right in front of her!
